Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the game began, a\Nwhole month has gone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And 2,000 people have died so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, none of the\Nplayers have been able to clear Floor 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to be a beta tester, and even I\Nhaven't found out where the boss's lair is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And today, finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're having a meeting to figure out how\Nto find and defeat the floor one boss.
