Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, people, now that everyone's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this meeting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I want to thank everyone\Nfor coming. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Diabel, and in this\Ngame, the job I rolled is night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, there's no job system in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys want to hear this or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our party found the boss room\Nat the top of the tower today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we need to defeat the\Nboss and make it to floor two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next step is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to tell everyone\Nwaiting in the Town of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beginnings that it is\Npossible to beat this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fact is, it's our duty as the\Nmost capable players here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you agree or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, glad to hear you're\Nall with me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's figure out how\Nwe're gonna beat the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, we'll team\Nup into parties of six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A typical party doesn't stand\Na chance against a floor boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a raid group made\Nup of multiple parties.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.79,0:03:31.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.14\alpha&H88&\fs30\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H5D5F65&\frz0.76\pos(783.113,421.5)\blur0.9}Do you {\fax-0.13}accept the {\fax-0.12}party invite?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.62,0:03:31.66,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fax-0.14\alpha&H88&\fs30\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H646469&\frz0.76\pos(783.113,421.5)\blur0.9}Do you {\fax-0.13}accept the {\fax-0.12}party invite?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got left out too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just everyone seems\Nlike they're already friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're Solo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to form a party with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what the guy just said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:04:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can't beat the boss on our own,\Nand it would only be for this fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HD6DCDD&\frz0.6\pos(1577.25,694.5)\blur0.75}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H3D3D40&\frz0.6\pos(1575.645,693)\bord0\blur0.9\3c&H616365&}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.16,0:04:08.28,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HD6DCDD&\frz0.6\pos(1577.25,694.5)\blur0.75\clip(m 1660.5 702 b 1692 652.5 1765.5 637.5 1782 699 l 1827 699 1825.5 618 1339.5 625.5 1335 723)}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.16,0:04:08.28,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H3D3D40&\frz0.6\pos(1575.645,693)\bord0\blur0.9\3c&H616365&\clip(m 1660.5 702 b 1692 652.5 1765.5 637.5 1782 699 l 1827 699 1825.5 618 1339.5 625.5 1335 723)}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HD6DCDD&\frz0.6\pos(1577.25,694.5)\blur0.75}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H3D3D40&\frz0.6\pos(1575.645,693)\bord0\blur0.9\3c&H616365&}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.12,0:04:09.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HD6DCDD&\frz0.6\pos(1578,694.5)\blur0.75}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.12,0:04:09.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fax0.11\alpha&H88&\fs36\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H3D3D40&\frz0.6\pos(1575.645,693)\blur0.9}Do you accept {\fax0.12}the party invite?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone's teamed up. Now then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Gabe. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we take on the boss, I want\Nto get something off my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know about the 2,000\Npeople who've died so far, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, some of you need to\Napologize to him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabe, I think I know\Nwho you're referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the ones who are\Nex-Beta testers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I mean them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day this stupid-ass game started, the\NBeta guys just up and vanished, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, they ditched all us beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snagged all the good hunting spots,\Nand they grabbed all the easy quests too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were the only ones\Ngetting stronger in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time they've\Nignored us like we're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, I bet there's some of them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on out beta testers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should make them apologize to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we should make them all give up\Ntheir money and the items they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't expect the party to\Ntrust them when they don't trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my name's Eugeo. Gabe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure I'm on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say the ex-beta testers\Nshould be blamed for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rookies' deaths because\Nthey didn't help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you want them to apologize\Nand give up their winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:06:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the item store hands these out for free\Nit's a guidebook you got one didn't you sure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i got one so what about it you know who\Nwas handing these out the ex-beta testers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen up everyone had\Nequal access to this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,information even so lots\Nof players still died now i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't come here to point\Nfingers at anyone i'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because i want to learn\Nfrom those player's deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I want to find out\Nhow we're going to beat the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we get back to the meeting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For info on the boss, it's all in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The latest issue of the\Nguidebook you just heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the book, the boss's\Nname is Illfang the Kobold Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, he'll be surrounded by his\Nminions, the Ruin Kobold Sentinels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Illfang carries an axe and a buckler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has four health bars, and\Nwhen the last one turns red,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he switches to a curved\Nsword-type weapon called a Talwar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can change his patterns of attack, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it for the briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.07,0:07:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the distribution of loot, money\Nwill be divided equally among everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The party that defeats\Nthe boss gets the XP,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and whoever gets an item gets to keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We leave tomorrow at 10 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meeting adjourned, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are pretty good, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think these taste good, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,—Huh, since I came to this town, I end\Nup eating at least one a day course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a trick to make it taste better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it with some of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it from the Heifer Strikes Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the quest in the village\Nbefore you get to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know how I did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer, but I didn't\Ncome to this town to eat good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I don't lose sight of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lock myself in a room in\Nthe town of Beginnings and slowly rot away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.89,0:09:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather stay the way I\Nam till the last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:10:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if a monster beats me and I die, I\Nwon't lose to this game or this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want a party member dying\Non me, so try not to die tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.57,0:10:23.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(958.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H040A02&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40}December {\fscx110}3{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2022{\fscx95\fsp1.5}   {\fsp-1.5}1st Floor • Forest Field
