Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.57,0:10:23.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(957,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}December {\fscx110}3{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2022{\fscx95\fsp1.5}   {\fsp-1.5}1st Floor • Forest Field
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go over it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the backup,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so our target's gonna be the boss's\Nminions, the Rue and Kobold Sentinels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use a sword skill to knock\Ntheir weapons up and out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I do, switch and jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the first time\Nyou've ever been in a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:10:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only got one thing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commence attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squads A and C, switch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squad B, block!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squad C, keep guarding\Nand prepare to switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, when you fall\Nback, regroup and flank them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squads D, E, and F, keep those\Nminions off us! Yeah, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought she was a beginner,\Nbut she's got good skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the tip of her sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the guidebook\Nwas right. Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the plan was for everyone\Nin the group to surround it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a Talwar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Nodachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't like the Beta!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diabel, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diabel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you were a beta\Ntester too, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were after the last\Nattack bonus, the rare item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just like me, a beta tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat the boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this death game started,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only thing I thought about\Nwas how I was gonna survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing else mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, I'll be seeing you, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you weren't like that, diabel—you\Nnever abandoned the other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought them together, you led\Neveryone and you fought brilliantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brilliantly You tried to\Naccomplish something I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hit him just like\Nwe did the minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:14:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh… Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hold this bastard off\Nuntil your health's back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me beat this sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last attack! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ain't gonna put nothing on us!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.71,0:17:36.59,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fax0.07\fs75\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HF4F1F2&\pos(1020.375,500.25)\frz10.84}Coat of Midnight
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.71,0:17:36.59,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.05\fax0.07\fs75\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H8E8E8F&\pos(1018.869,498)\frz10.84}Coat of Midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was some fine swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's victory is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop cheering!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you let Diabel die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I said. Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew the technique\Nthe boss was going to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Taboo would have stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be a beta tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew the boss's attack patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew, but he kept it from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet he's not the\Nonly beta tester here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, show yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad at this\Nrate for everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you guys think I used\Nto be a beta tester?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not cool to put me in\Nthe same class as those noobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the thousand people who scored\Na slot in SAO's beta were rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were so green, they didn't\Neven know how to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, even you guys are\Nbetter than they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But me, I'm nothing like those guys, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the beta, I made it to floors that\Nwere higher than any of the other testers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew about the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I fought tons of monsters with\Nway more sword skills on higher floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a bunch of other things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.15,0:20:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than any info broker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then you're\Nworse than a beta tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a goddamn cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a beta tester and a cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a beater!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beater?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.31,0:20:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me a beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't confuse\Nme with those beta testers anymore.
