Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.09,0:20:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were fighting the\Nboss, you called me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mess up the pronunciation?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you even know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look right about here, you'll\Nsee another HP gauge under yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a name written\Nright next to it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.03,0:21:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.87,0:21:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name's Kirito. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was there the whole\Ntime and I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can become powerful here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the day comes when someone you\Ntrust invites you to join a guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't turn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there are limits to\Nwhat a solo player can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're solo.
